{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"李克勤夫婦設宴招待國羽奧運選手  53歲盧淑儀凍齡同框「梁王」超吸睛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b172a2d3cf0e696c6affd2cdd1e82deb/2026-11/KF_0_61.jpg\"/>\n<p>李克勤與太太盧淑儀是圈中著名的羽毛球狂熱份子，與國家羽毛球隊（國羽）多位主力球員私交甚篤。近日適逢多位國羽頂尖猛將來港出戰重要賽事，李克勤夫婦隨即化身「最強應援團」，不僅日間到場支持，晚上更設宴款待一眾好友，以盡顯地主之誼。</p>\n<h2>李克勤搭膊頭融入國羽名將圈</h2>\n<p>昨日（27日）李克勤在微博分享多張飯局上的合照，興奮寫道：「國羽好友們來香港比賽，日間看球，晚上聚聚」。身穿黑色連帽衛衣搭配闊腳牛仔褲的李克勤，在席間顯得心情大靚，不僅與梁偉鏗、王昶、馮彥哲及陳柏陽逐一勾肩搭背影相，大合照時更與眾人對着鏡頭大擺搞怪表情與「V」字手勢。</p>\n<img alt=\"58歲的李克勤已入行40年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/686fed4acab6501bf8a54a5542ef6bf0/2026-11/lee_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤是運動健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d72a60b076cc2145351ba38180d64f6d/2026-11/lee_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤是著名的曼聯球迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cad0f9b49bdc7adeb247b5a1477d0ffe/2026-11/lee_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤曾與太太盧淑儀到英國睇波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3364ada24951ce69a5c64c199ccfa2aa/2026-11/lee_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤曾向曼聯球員送禮，被指行為「過於熱情」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b3a20f69b2dc53a3bb5688bebcc91ed/2026-11/lee_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤昨日（27日）在微博分享睇比賽的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de88f9399310c101b8f81235c540d463/2026-11/lee_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與國家羽毛球隊多位主力球員私交甚篤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f87fb1f51bdfe2ed019adea8bee67729/2026-11/lee_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"（左起）王昶、梁偉鏗、李克勤、陳柏陽與馮彥哲聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ba05e235dd718832d142d8064009564/2026-11/lee_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與陳柏陽合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c001507dbfb4a47d9f1eef287700b21/2026-11/lee_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與梁偉鏗合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2ece1de17f6e1cd9b85d414f46efd91/2026-11/lee_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與王昶合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a6ee8a4c4ef7aded2b70da3ab1f4fbb/2026-11/lee_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與馮彥哲合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4fce93c126d5dc9196ad70da08585760/2026-11/lee_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤的太太盧淑儀（右二）出現在另一場聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e24f1ab61468dc4ba007e30f074a87ad/2026-11/lee_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤昨日（27日）在微博發文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0da15c0ee8a825f196ecea18b56d0a0e/2026-11/lee_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤試過去大馬開演唱會後踢波，盧淑儀都有同行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fb8e9766dbec2812ee4e736db1e61c1/2023-06/-1VmwKz5iXGGbCSIdhX4qRP-3-mslI7XliCPCJYgjwg.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤是體育狂迷，亦愛打高爾夫球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1db11cf5608f674b438a43f09829223f/2023-06/hacken1206_185067909_150267640401407_8428121897105838788_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤熱愛打羽毛球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f18fa7ed7d275de6d781b2ba03d86b60/2026-11/lee_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盧淑儀近年愛上打羽毛球。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33393755028459acaee3197eaf635cb1/2023-11/lo_suk_yee_emily_1498725070_1547740528698065384_1725764948.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馬晉同盧淑儀成日約打波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc5fae0b77018686fa86f9b9a5758610/2023-03/6d6635a7gy1hbmjljdvhej23402c07wk.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"前世界羽毛球冠軍馬晉是李克勤好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1cb4c5394004aa893220c46c0d0dd3a/2023-03/6d6635a7gy1hbmjlfum7ij22c03404qr.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與國家隊成員鄭思維切磋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de54b79aa3de837dcd3146dd38d792f/2023-06/hacken1206_244436610_935487140697275_8595535562106194877_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤遇上混雙名將鄭思維（右）同黃雅瓊（左）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/629d9a2760801017aeb3e69aa3a63424/2023-06/hacken1206_244525638_4417310475050047_336239858199248620_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與大馬羽毛球名將李宗偉好老友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca326a3ab79b038b63ed1406c506b6fa/2023-06/Nwxd-hryfqhm1216670.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與盧淑儀經常約國手打羽毛球，包括前國家女雙及混雙選手李茵暉（中）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/315bfd82f52784b7e4407623e0cdafb4/2024-07/71418561gy1hiw12n2uczj21400u0gux.jpg\"/>\n<h2>奧運銀牌「梁王」拖鞋赴會</h2>\n<p>從李克勤分享的照片所見，當晚的星級飯局氣氛相當輕鬆愉快。而且國羽名將陣容鼎盛，當中包括在巴黎奧運勇奪男雙銀牌的「梁王組合」梁偉鏗與王昶，以及混雙名將馮彥哲和陳柏陽等。眾人換上輕便私服赴會，王昶腳踏「洞洞拖鞋」，而梁偉鏗則穿上簡單的平底拖鞋，打扮隨性且貼地。</p>\n<h2>盧淑儀擺出韓式心心賣萌</h2>\n<p>李克勤的太太盧淑儀也有參與另一場聚會，見到與梁偉鏗、馮彥哲等年輕國手合照。現年53歲的盧淑儀當晚穿上藍色牛仔外套配黑色長褲，一頭飄逸長髮顯得溫柔大方。面對鏡頭時，盧淑儀緊貼潮流雙手比出「韓式愛心」，展露甜美笑容。不少網民大讚盧淑儀皮膚緊緻，保養得宜，完全看不出真實年齡。</p>\n<img alt=\"李克勤被譽為「零瑕疵歌手」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb7bfe747fe9d6b4073f282ea23d1fac/2026-04/WhatsApp_Image_2026-04-01_at_15_58_13_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤早前舉行巡迴演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46608907f6c1e00e86dc0778ac09d6ca/2026-04/WhatsApp_Image_2026-04-01_at_15_58_11_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤唱功穩定、音準極高，幾乎不走音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3135b6de323336508b80a2c33cb526e/2026-04/WhatsApp_Image_2026-04-01_at_15_58_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤多年來有不少經典歌曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d9b8a9ad5cc47484987928519da39e3/2026-04/WhatsApp_Image_2026-04-01_at_15_58_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤多年來專注歌唱事業都賺不少，但娶得有投資眼光的賢妻盧淑儀亦令他身家上升。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d77274c1d526e0dda91c3c53ab34ce47/2023-04/loy15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤和盧淑儀在2006年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1023594623669a9525ac581f61523317/2023-11/CK__9532.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盧淑儀婚後為李克勤誕下兩子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/001376b28c6fce237c159245f2bf57b1/2022-09/unknown_129792486_675479866482208_3830225771908837403_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與盧淑儀育有兩子，大仔李立二與細仔李力司。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fc969ee1d51e5e632dd7722ccc47601/2025-10/b20.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁是李克勤與盧淑儀的大仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9d942b156fc4cb7bfda38de6e6788bf/2025-10/B7.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與太太盧淑儀的大仔李立仁，在美國留學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38e5abc1e9b00e08ecc8269598e1118e/2025-09/A4_0_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤大仔李立仁遺傳爸爸的音樂天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4ef39111c33899a2211fb007f2619d1/2024-10/117_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤與盧淑儀早年安排兩個仔入讀香港加拿大國際學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d32e4260bd2d5fc451817b640c9a84c2/2024-12/shirley_msc_1686652002_3124185893245949560_10110135241.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁搣甩劉翔的影子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5f563dbb39b9ed0b3fa8bbe85d821c0/2025-10/ryan22102007_1761140248_3749038585753247681_5025953685.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁曾分享慶祝生日的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc8f84b9f90643b8785e0251bda91ce8/2024-10/464294037_1095903659210564_8762994867136302626_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤大仔李立仁在IG上載近照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eff76b925d4edee04cea999eb1695802/2026-07/ryan_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤的大仔李立仁近日放假返港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ff25ddad49fd3483bf2218d8ae8e80/2026-07/ryan_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁未知是否已見姚焯菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/450628d981aa3c5bb74b50ddab2b02ad/2026-07/ryan_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤大仔李立仁戴著墨鏡在山頂自拍，散發「星味」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34b0c37ffb1fe18edf77c546fd85a0d1/2026-07/ryan_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤19歲兒子李立仁在IG又分享愛犬的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15788cab5719fc98a0551eeb6d8c5ca2/2026-07/ryan_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁曾在IG分享爸爸李克勤的探班相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d03288d667dd828c3e27da03a8ab449/2026-07/ryan_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁曾分享中學畢業畫面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c375bee93259afa70c93eea708cb6f1/2025-10/B2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁有份唱歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f684403decf76b84297326b9c199995/2025-10/B5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁在台上感謝父母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3385e287d670fbd0204c9c84e8d2b3e/2025-10/B6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁近年不時貼出生活照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d571100b21e32c68cc481d4dcbfa9a0b/2025-09/A1_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁獲美國紐約大學藝術學院（NYU Tisch School of the Arts）取錄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/803c320fb80b28daa5cd418c02688cf9/2025-09/A7_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指李立仁主修電影與電視製作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a565c42d92eda78ae922b244b7f8c0cd/2025-09/A3_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李克勤曾透露一對兒子性格迥異，李立仁遺傳其音樂天賦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/770af86a717a64a478d9828e81f7d375/2024-12/LiY8sXR9WTTVs9pGH2uQrGLyBmWnBmgDZmOSuWZjkrk.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁曾奪校際音樂節鋼琴獨奏項目季軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dc381ef67a35371dda9431eb708016e/2024-12/ubSCYhwPDYNVTcyu_fCFsqsOVBhdYkq3flA-ln5QPpY.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁跟爸爸同樣是曼聯球迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8acff7545fdc0dbc561f57da27a561c/2024-12/UyvLuS-UGSPospYdrL-DzJdZyoZCryNi0Ey9LNBMvSw.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁文武雙全。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dde08a08a66fe81ffd3d88c7b1d6f200/2024-12/FeEOXzu2qvbPry17RtNFmI-_DM4RL18TvEEeZrxBHmY.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.886158+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":577,"images":55,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:15:45.278913+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.536587+00:00","content_hash":"6fae03659b9b10a302d51934e546561470d7bb46b6716550465c60172e72e2cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}